[Term]
id: PREFER:0000000
name: rate process metric
def: "A key calculated process metric that represents a quantitative metric, describing rates or fluxes associated, for instance, wiht growth, product formation, substrate consumption, or respiration, during a fermentation process." []
synonym: "key precision fermentation rate calculated process metric" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000078 ! key process metric

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000001
name: scattered light measured process variable
def: "A precision fermentation measured process variable that indicates the intensity of optical radiation detected after a light beam interacts with a fermentation culture and is redirected to a detector by scattering processes within a bioreactor or fermentation system during a fermentation process." [PMID:33573846]
comment: The measured process variable is an instrument-derived signal recorded under a defined optical geometry and reported as arbitrary units (A.U.).
synonym: "backscatter measured process variable" RELATED []
synonym: "reflectance measured process variable" RELATED []
is_a: PREFER:0000099 ! scattered light base method variable
is_a: PREFER:9000001 ! precision fermentation measured process variable
relationship: OBI:0001938 PREFER:0000066 ! has value specification arbitrary unit

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000002
name: fermentation project
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A precision fermentation process that consist of a single fermentation experiment or multiple related experiments." []
synonym: "project" EXACT []
is_a: OBI:0000066 ! investigation
is_a: PREFER:9000003 ! precision fermentation process
relationship: RO:0000057 OBI:0000245 ! has participant organization

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000003
name: fermentation experiment
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A precision fermentation process that consists of sets of fermentation runs conducted within the same project, all following a shared experimental approach or protocol." []
synonym: "experiment" EXACT []
is_a: OBI:0000070 ! assay
is_a: PREFER:9000003 ! precision fermentation process
relationship: BFO:0000050 PREFER:0000002 ! part of fermentation project

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000004
name: fermentation run
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A precision fermentation process that is carried out under defined experimental conditions (e.g., temperature, pH, agitation) using a single bioreactor system." []
synonym: "cell culture process" BROAD []
xref: CHMO:0001624
