[Term]
id: PREFER:0000005
name: alkaline cultivation process variable
def: "A cultivation variable that represents the alkalinity related aspects of a fermentation cultivation process, grouping setpoint process variables and measured process variables that describe or regulate the pH and buffering state of the cultivation environment." []
is_a: PREFER:0000008 ! precision fermentation cultivation process variable

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000006
name: gravimetric feed rate setpoint process variable
def: "A setpoint process variable that represents the target rate at which the feed (based on its weight) is added to a bioreactor or fermentation system during a fermentation process." []
