relationship: PREFER:8000020 PREFER:0000054 ! setpoint of stirrer speed measured process variable

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000029
name: pressure cultivation process variable
def: "A cultivation process variable that represents the pressure related aspects of a fermentation cultivation process, grouping setpoint process variables and measured process variables that describe or regulate the pressure state within the cultivation environment." []
is_a: PREFER:0000008 ! precision fermentation cultivation process variable

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000030
name: aeration gas type setpoint process variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A precision fermentation dissolved oxygen setpoint process variable that represents the type of gas used for aeration in a bioreactor or fermentation system during a fermentation process, which may include aire or specific gases such as pure oxygen, nitrogen or carbon dioxide." []
synonym: "precision fermentation aeration gas type setpoint process variable" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000119 ! dissolved oxygen setpoint process variable

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000031
name: maximum aeration setpoint process variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A precision fermentation dissolved oxygen setpoint process variable that represents the target maximum rate of at which gas can be supplied to be regulated and or maintained within a bioreactor or fermentation system during a fermentation process." []
synonym: "maximum aeration setpoint" EXACT []
synonym: "precision fermentation maximum aeration setpoint process variable" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000119 ! dissolved oxygen setpoint process variable
relationship: OBI:0001938 uom:L.min-1 ! has value specification liter per minute
relationship: PREFER:8000020 PREFER:0000055 ! setpoint of air flow rate measured process variable

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000032
name: minimum aeration setpoint process variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A precision fermentation dissolved oxygen setpoint process variable that represents the target minimum rate of at which gas can be supplied to be regulated and or maintained within a bioreactor or fermentation system during a fermentation process." []
synonym: "minimum aeration setpoint" EXACT []
synonym: "precision fermentation minimum aeration setpoint process variable" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000119 ! dissolved oxygen setpoint process variable
relationship: OBI:0001938 uom:L.min-1 ! has value specification liter per minute
relationship: PREFER:8000020 PREFER:0000055 ! setpoint of air flow rate measured process variable

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000033
name: dissolved oxygen cultivation process variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A cultivation process variable that represents the dissolved oxygen related aspects of a fermentation cultivation process, grouping setpoint process variables and measured process variables that describe or regulate the concentration of oxygen dissolved in the cultivation environment." []
synonym: "DO cultivation process variable" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000008 ! precision fermentation cultivation process variable

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000034
name: starting optical density measured process variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A precision fermentation measured process variable that indicates the initial optical density (OD) of the fermentation culture from a bioreactor or fermentation system during a fermentation process." []
comment: The starting OD measurement is either measured (by taking a sample after inoculation and measuring the cell density spectophotometrically at 600nm or 900nm wavelength) or  calculated (by knowing the final OD of the seed culture, volume inoculated and final cultivation volume).
synonym: "precision fermentation starting optical density measured process variable" EXACT []
synonym: "starting OD measured process variable" EXACT OMO:0003012 []
is_a: PREFER:0000097 ! optical density base method variable
is_a: PREFER:9000001 ! precision fermentation measured process variable
relationship: OBI:0001938 PREFER:7000006 ! has value specification unit of optical density

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000035
name: final seed optical density measured process variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A precision fermentation measured process variable that indicates the cell density of the seed culture for the process at the time it is inoculated  to the bioreactor or fermentation system." []
synonym: "final seed OD measured process variable" EXACT []
synonym: "precision fermentation project final seed optical density measured process variable" EXACT []
is_a: PREFER:0000073 ! seed cultivation process variable
is_a: PREFER:9000001 ! precision fermentation measured process variable
relationship: OBI:0001938 PREFER:7000006 ! has value specification unit of optical density

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000036
name: initial culture volume measured process variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A precision fermentation measured process variable that indicates the total volume of the culture of a bioreactor or fermentation system, at the beginning of the process, representing the sum of fermentation medium and seed culture." []
synonym: "initial production culture volume measured process variable" EXACT []
synonym: "precision fermentation initial culture volume measured process variable" EXACT []
synonym: "starting culture volume measured process variable" EXACT []
synonym: "starting production culture volume measured process variable" EXACT []
