name: feed medium cultivation process variable
namespace: precision_fermentation
def: "A fermentation medium cultivation process variable that represents the feed medium related aspects of a fermentation cultivation process, grouping setpoint process variables and measured process variables that describe or regulate the addition and state of fresh feed media within the cultivation environment." []
is_a: PREFER:0000024 ! fermentation medium cultivation process variable
relationship: PREFER:8000013 PREFER:0000189 ! has feed profile type feed profile type setpoint process variable

[Term]
