[Term]
id: PREFER:8000041
name: Ambr250 - Satorius bioreactor
def: "A bench-scale bioreactor system produced by Sartorius with individual vessel working volumes ranging from 100 to 250 mL. The Ambr250 is an automated, high-throughput, parallel  mini-bioreactor platform that can handle 12-24 independent vessels simultaneously. It supports mammalian, insect, and microbial cell cultures, and includes automated liquid handling for process monitoring and control.\nThe system provides a highly controlled cultivation environment, and an efficient and rapid scale-down platform for evaluating a wide range of process conditions and strains, with scalability to both bench-scale and larger stirred tank bioreactors." [https://www.sartorius.com/en/products/fermentation-bioreactors/ambr-multi-parallel-bioreactors/ambr-250-high-throughput]
is_a: PREFER:0000014 ! bioreactor
relationship: PREFER:8000008 PREFER:0000186 ! has bioreactor scale bench bioreactor scale

[Term]
id: PREFER:8000042
name: Ambr250 modular - Sartorius bioreactor
def: "A bench-scale bioreactor system produced by Sartorius with individual vessel working volumes ranging from 100 to 250 mL. The Ambr250 is a high-throughput, parallel mini-bioreactor platform that can handle 2-8 fully integrated single use vessels simultaneously. It supports mammalian, insect, and microbial cell cultures, but does not have automated liquid handling.\nThe system provides a highly controlled cultivation environment, and an efficient and rapid scale-down platform for evaluating a wide range of process conditions and strains, with scalability to both bench-scale and larger stirred tank bioreactors." [https://www.sartorius.com/en/products/fermentation-bioreactors/ambr-multi-parallel-bioreactors/ambr-250-modular]
is_a: PREFER:0000014 ! bioreactor
relationship: PREFER:8000008 PREFER:0000186 ! has bioreactor scale bench bioreactor scale

