name: cloaca
def: "Common chamber into which the intestines and excretory system opens. Arises during development in all vertebrates, but in many it becomes subdivided, lost or incorporated into other structures." [ISBN:0073040584, Wikipedia:Cloaca]
synonym: "cloacal chamber" RELATED [AAO:0000095]
synonym: "vent" RELATED [XAO:0000244]
