synonym: "duct of Wirsung" EXACT [Wikipedia:Pancreatic_duct]
synonym: "ductus pancreatis ventralis" RELATED []
synonym: "hepaticopancreatic duct" RELATED [BTO:0002362]
synonym: "main pancreatic duct" EXACT [MA:0000126]
synonym: "pancreatic duct" BROAD [MESH:A03.734.667]
